{
  "name": "Menacing",
  "type": "ability",
  "img": "icons/svg/ice-aura.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> Training (1) in Intimidation</p><p>People tend to not mess with you, due to your intimidating manner.</p><ul><li><p>You have <strong>Advantag</strong>e on <strong>Intimidation</strong> checks to threaten, intimidate, or start arguments.</p></li><li><p>Most people will be afraid of arousing your ire, and will try to avoid doing anything that might anger you.</p></li><li><p>As an <strong>Action</strong>, you can attempt to demoralize one creature you can see within <strong>5 spaces</strong> of you.</p><ul><li><p>Make an <strong>4:1</strong> <strong>Intimidation</strong> check resisted by the target's <strong>Willpower</strong>.</p></li><li><p>If the target fails the check, they are <strong>Frightened</strong> until the end of your next turn.</p></li><li><p>If the target succeeds, they cannot be <strong>Frightened</strong> by you in this way for the rest of the encounter.</p></li></ul></li></ul>",
